abstract: >
  C implementation of the breakthrough O(m log^(2/3) n) algorithm for
  single-source shortest paths on directed graphs with non-negative edge
  weights, based on the theoretical algorithm by Duan et al. (2025). This
  implementation provides optimized data structures, cross-platform support,
  and comprehensive testing for the first deterministic algorithm to break
  the O(m + n log n) barrier established by Dijkstra's algorithm in 1959.
